		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギ『おう！　[Name:TrainerName Idx="0"]くん
[Name:PokemonName Idx="1"]の　ようすは　どうかね？[Ctrl2:PageClear ]</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
